# Replaces the stock 20-dracut.rules, which contains
#   allow perm=any uid=0 : dir=/var/tmp/
# so that dracut can build an initramfs on the host. On an image-mode
# system the initramfs is built into the image and dracut never runs on
# the machine, and that rule let root run any binary dropped in /var/tmp
# (found by the boot test). Intentionally empty.
